# A concert poster over the desk (issue 076, redrawn): an abstract impression of a gig poster with no text or name. An unframed paper poster with a pale border and tape at the top corners; a dark night field with a few stars, a big blush planet and a small blue moon over a glowing orange and butter horizon, a pink cloud band and dark water below. Big shapes and a limited palette, a new composition in the spirit of the references (poster examples 1 to 7), not a copy of any. 32x16 wall slot.
size: 32x16
